{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不要一个人承受委屈  (Refusing to Let Him Bear Every Grievance Alone)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at her apartment after the banquet, Xin Huimei deliberately picks a quarrel to make stoic Chun Yuqiao stop hiding his stomach pain and frustrations behind polite apologies. Listen to their heartfelt exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别坐地上了，明天上午还要赶飞机呢，赶紧上去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "刚才派对的时候你一直黑着脸，害大家没有人敢靠近你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你有想过我的感受吗？大家一起玩会儿都不行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对不起，这种场合我不太擅长。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "到底怎样，你才能在疼的时候告诉我呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我总吃药不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "女朋友会治病，还要医生干嘛？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我就是无理取闹，而且是故意的，你为什么总道歉啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "为什么我不管做什么，你都要一味地迁就我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "恋人之间不就是应该有什么都说出来吗？我不要你一个人承受所有的委屈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是一个很好的女孩，是我无论如何也绝对不能辜负的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想尽我全力地好好爱你，所以没有什么委屈，做什么都是值得的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "难得你睡得好没有叫你，我自己去机场了，记得吃药。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别坐地上了，明天上午还要赶飞机呢，赶紧上去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not sit on the floor—you have a morning flight to catch tomorrow, so head up and rest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "刚才派对的时候你一直黑着脸，害大家没有人敢靠近你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At the party just now you wore a dark frown the whole time, scaring everyone away from you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你有想过我的感受吗？大家一起玩会儿都不行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you think about my feelings? Could you not mingle with everyone for even a little while?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对不起，这种场合我不太擅长。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry—I have never been good at big social scenes like that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "到底怎样，你才能在疼的时候告诉我呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What will it take for you to actually tell me when you are in pain?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我总吃药不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Taking painkillers all the time is not good for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "女朋友会治病，还要医生干嘛？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If a girlfriend could cure illnesses, what would we need doctors for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我就是无理取闹，而且是故意的，你为什么总道歉啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was making a scene on purpose—why do you keep apologising to me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "为什么我不管做什么，你都要一味地迁就我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you endlessly give in to me no matter what I do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "恋人之间不就是应该有什么都说出来吗？我不要你一个人承受所有的委屈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Should lovers not share everything openly? I refuse to let you bear every grievance alone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是一个很好的女孩，是我无论如何也绝对不能辜负的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are a wonderful woman, someone whom I must never let down under any circumstances.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想尽我全力地好好爱你，所以没有什么委屈，做什么都是值得的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to love you with everything I have, so nothing feels like a grievance—it is all worth it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "难得你睡得好没有叫你，我自己去机场了，记得吃药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You were sleeping so soundly I did not wake you; I headed to the airport myself—remember your medicine.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别坐地上了，明天上午还要赶飞机呢，赶紧上去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "刚才派对的时候你一直黑着脸，害大家没有人敢靠近你。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你有想过我的感受吗？大家一起玩会儿都不行吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
